(7737763, 1275696, 273752, '<td valign="top">I like the lines leading from left to right to the ferry.  Colors appear a little flat to me though (no doubt the overcast conditions).  I like it.</td>', 'I like the lines leading from left to right to the ferry.  Colors appear a little flat to me though (no doubt the overcast conditions).  I like it.', '2023-02-04 20:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
