(7737766, 1275713, 273752, '<td valign="top">While a bit grainy, it does work for the coin, which has its own natural scratches and imperfections.  I like it.</td>', 'While a bit grainy, it does work for the coin, which has its own natural scratches and imperfections.  I like it.', '2023-02-04 21:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
