(7737922, 1275751, 18505, '<td valign="top">I love this image!  Since I live 1000 miles from the nearest ocean, the few times I have seen whales "in person" have been exciting and memorable.  The first time I was in Alaska on a halibut boat.  I was in back and the guys were in front - fishing.  A whale actually breached...close enough to the boat that I could have gotten a tremendous shot.  However, I was so gobsmacked at actually seeing a whale that I stood there, mouth open, in awe, and completely forgetting the camera in my hands.  It was like time stood still.  The memory is seared in my brain - the picture...well, I do have the memory.  Your image is a perfect representation of the challenge and underscored in my humble opinion.  Thank you for bringing back to mind a memory I cherish.</td>', 'I love this image!  Since I live 1000 miles from the nearest ocean, the few times I have seen whales "in person" have been exciting and memorable.  The first time I was in Alaska on a halibut boat.  I was in back and the guys were in front - fishing.  A whale actually breached...close enough to the boat that I could have gotten a tremendous shot.  However, I was so gobsmacked at actually seeing a whale that I stood there, mouth open, in awe, and completely forgetting the camera in my hands.  It was like time stood still.  The memory is seared in my brain - the picture...well, I do have the memory.  Your image is a perfect representation of the challenge and underscored in my humble opinion.  Thank you for bringing back to mind a memory I cherish.', '2023-02-06 13:02:53.000000', NULL, 0),
